WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:03.400
My passionate Idol Activities,

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:06.380
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:11.570
I believe in you!

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:14.070
Please Ran, please Ran, please Ran! {??}

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:15.950
Ready...

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:20.750
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:21.960
Yes!

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:23.530
The winner is Ichigo!

00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:24.540
Yay!

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:25.870
Ichigo-tan!

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:27.460
Sorry...

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:29.570
Ichigo-san, how do you feel about winning?

00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:31.830
I'm really happy about it.

00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:35.840
And there you have it. The outfits used for the upcoming Newcomer Idol concert will be...

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:37.600
Angely Sugar!

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:40.250
We're all gonna match! Love you!

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:41.160
Yeah!

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:43.860
I can't wait for us to all sing together wearing Angely Sugar.

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:51.030
An up-and-coming idol will be the star of our next Angely Sugar commercial.

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:51.990
The candidates are...

00:00:51.990 --> 00:00:53.990
We'll go with Ichigo-chan.

00:00:53.990 --> 00:00:56.000
Hoshimiya Ichigo-chan.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:59.270
I think she'll be the perfect partner for this little one.

00:02:36.310 --> 00:02:40.390
All of today's popular new idols from different agencies

00:02:40.390 --> 00:02:41.720
will come together for one big live event.

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:44.010
And <i>we've</i> been asked to join them!

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:45.470
We can't take this sitting down.

00:02:45.470 --> 00:02:47.230
You're right about that. {FUCK EVERYTHING}

00:02:47.230 --> 00:02:51.020
Oh man, I don't know what I'd do if I met the other girls backstage.

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:53.980
Should I get a handshake? No, I want an autograph!

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:57.560
Then should we go ahead and decide which Angely Sugar outfits we're going to wear?

00:02:57.560 --> 00:02:59.990
Aye! Let's wear matching clothes!

00:03:02.210 --> 00:03:05.150
Angely Sugar's cute no matter how many times I see it. {clothes? outfits?}

00:03:05.150 --> 00:03:06.240
What do you think?

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:07.490
I have a confession...

00:03:07.490 --> 00:03:12.710
If I were to wear anything other than Loli Gothic clothes, my heart would burst open and I would die a horrible death!

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:14.110
But our uniforms aren't Loli Gothic.

00:03:14.110 --> 00:03:15.600
It's a figure of speech!

00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:17.260
Didn't we agree to rock paper scissors for it?

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:21.260
This is all because <i>you</i> said we had to wear matching outfits!

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:23.220
I thought it would improve our teamwork.

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:26.310
I think the Ice Blue Frill coord would look good on you.

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:28.000
I want to wear a really cute one!

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:28.660
Stop it!

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:30.020
Starmiya!

00:03:30.360 --> 00:03:31.520
Oh, Starmiya!

00:03:31.930 --> 00:03:34.300
Nice choice with the daily special lunch set.

00:03:34.300 --> 00:03:34.950
Thanks.

00:03:34.950 --> 00:03:37.230
Come with me, the Headmistress is calling you.

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:38.620
The Headmistress?

00:03:38.620 --> 00:03:39.690
Hurry up!

00:03:39.690 --> 00:03:40.700
Coming!

00:03:43.060 --> 00:03:44.480
I've got a bad feeling about this.

00:03:44.480 --> 00:03:45.530
Really?

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:47.990
A commercial gig?!

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:50.900
Yes, and moreover, it's a solo commercial.

00:03:50.900 --> 00:03:52.370
Please let me do it!

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:54.250
Don't you want to know what it's about first?

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:57.210
That would be this little guy's commercial, yeah! {those?}

00:03:57.210 --> 00:03:58.760
Angely Bear!

00:03:59.090 --> 00:04:02.220
It's a present from the top designer Mrs. Amahane.

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:04.740
She was also the one who chose you.

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:07.100
Amahane-san chose me?

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:13.100
The Angely Bear was originally a stuffed animal that Mrs. Amahane made for her own child.

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:15.980
It has great personal significance to her.

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:18.110
She wants you to do its commercial.

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:20.390
Do you understand what that means?

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:23.570
Yes! I'll give it everything I've got!

00:04:23.570 --> 00:04:25.120
Well said!

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:27.530
I'll give you details on your schedule later.

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:28.580
Got it!

00:04:29.070 --> 00:04:31.080
You're starring solo in a commercial?!

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:33.190
Congratulations!

00:04:33.190 --> 00:04:34.670
But there's this huge problem...

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:36.130
What's that? You nervous?

00:04:36.780 --> 00:04:38.090
The schedules conflict!

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:39.380
What?

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:42.810
We've got shooting almost every day after school until the concert.

00:04:42.810 --> 00:04:45.170
That means you won't be able to train with us.

00:04:45.170 --> 00:04:47.890
And if it runs late, our rehearsals will start to suffer too.

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:49.520
Looks like the concert will be impossible.

00:04:49.520 --> 00:04:51.890
We'll need to find a replacement for you.

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:54.390
I want us all to be together...

00:04:54.390 --> 00:04:56.800
Sorry, I'll go refuse their offer.

00:04:57.440 --> 00:04:59.110
Our concert came first, after all.

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:00.760
You can't pass up this commercial!

00:05:00.760 --> 00:05:02.110
No refusing allowed!

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:06.140
It's not every day a commercial offer comes, and even rarer that you do it solo.

00:05:06.140 --> 00:05:07.410
It's an amazing chance!

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:09.410
If you should refuse anything, it's our concert.

00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:12.120
You understand which is more important, right?

00:05:14.320 --> 00:05:16.120
Got it, I'll do both!

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:17.120
What?

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:20.230
Both the commercial and the concert are important to me.

00:05:20.230 --> 00:05:21.920
I can't refuse either of them!

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:23.920
You'll have a hard time balancing them both.

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:25.990
There's more to this concert than just the performance.

00:05:25.990 --> 00:05:31.580
The photo shoot for the pamphlet, the interviews, and other promotional work take a lot of time too.

00:05:31.580 --> 00:05:33.680
I can do it. I'll be fine.

00:05:34.320 --> 00:05:35.390
Oh well. {but it can't be heeelped}

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:37.280
Got it, we'll help you out.

00:05:37.280 --> 00:05:39.560
Ichigo-tan, you'll be fine!

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:42.420
Just be sure not to hold Yurika-sama back.

00:05:42.420 --> 00:05:43.320
If you do...

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:45.130
You won't not cheer her on?

00:05:45.130 --> 00:05:49.160
If you thought I'd say that then you're not... totally wrong...

00:05:49.550 --> 00:05:51.200
Everyone...

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:54.160
However, all of your breaks and nights belong to us. {ichigo bird? love you?}

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:55.700
We won't let you sleep.

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:56.500
Right!

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:02.460
<i>The first meeting is at the Angely Tower Building?</i>

00:06:07.210 --> 00:06:09.370
This place is amazing!

00:06:09.370 --> 00:06:10.930
Aikatsu!

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:16.730
My name is Hoshimiya Ichigo. I'll be in your care.

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:17.870
Same here.

00:06:17.870 --> 00:06:20.020
We look forward to working with you.

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:22.970
We should air the commercial during prime time

00:06:22.970 --> 00:06:26.170
and put the charm of Angely Bear on full display.

00:06:26.170 --> 00:06:27.780
Full display...

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:30.530
Next, we'll have the director explain the storyboard.

00:06:31.690 --> 00:06:32.740
It's like a manga.

00:06:33.060 --> 00:06:35.750
It's a rough outline of how the commercial should look.

00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:37.350
It's still open to changes.

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:42.170
I heard you were a fan of Angely Sugar, so I want to hear your opinion as well.

00:06:42.830 --> 00:06:44.500
Let's make this a good commercial.

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:45.550
Okay!

00:06:48.890 --> 00:06:50.590
Sorry for running so late.

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:51.550
Welcome back.

00:06:50.790 --> 00:06:52.530
Ichigo-tan!

00:06:52.530 --> 00:06:55.160
Otome's about to run out of Ichigo-tan power...

00:06:55.160 --> 00:06:56.060
There, there.

00:06:56.060 --> 00:06:58.100
Have you listened to the song yet?

00:06:58.100 --> 00:07:00.060
For the entire ride home!

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:01.820
Great, because you've got the first line.

00:07:01.820 --> 00:07:02.550
What?!

00:07:02.550 --> 00:07:04.110
It's a big responsibility.

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:13.490
So you have a younger brother.

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:14.400
That's right.

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:16.740
When you fight, who usually apologizes first?

00:07:18.400 --> 00:07:20.040
Probably me.

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:22.750
Dinner doesn't taste as good when you're having a fight.

00:07:25.600 --> 00:07:27.120
Be aware of every last finger!

00:07:27.120 --> 00:07:27.760
Right!

00:07:35.620 --> 00:07:38.560
What point do you want the viewers to focus on?

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:41.110
Of course, it's the magnificence of Yurika-sama...

00:07:41.110 --> 00:07:43.560
The perfect synchronization of our dance.

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:45.560
Wow, now <i>that</i> sounds exciting.

00:07:45.890 --> 00:07:48.940
We'll keep the questions coming after the commercial break.

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:50.760
Including revealing Yurika-sama's secret!

00:07:50.760 --> 00:07:52.820
Don't give them weird expectations!

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:04.670
Headmistress! I've got bad, bad, bad news!

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:08.580
Starmiya's commercial gig conflicts with her concert!

00:08:08.580 --> 00:08:12.590
I'm well aware. She asked me to allow her to do both herself.

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:13.490
What?!

00:08:13.490 --> 00:08:15.720
It's too much to do both! Why didn't you stop h—

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:17.080
Sensei.

00:08:17.080 --> 00:08:19.050
A student is saying that she will do it.

00:08:19.050 --> 00:08:21.980
Is it not our job to watch over and guide her during these times?

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:26.500
Adversity allows for greater growth.

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:30.480
It is facing and overcoming difficulty that makes one an idol.

00:08:30.830 --> 00:08:31.820
Here.

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:35.280
Ichigo said to give this to you so that you don't feel lonely.

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:36.620
Ichigo-tan!

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:38.540
What, Ichigo's not coming?

00:08:38.540 --> 00:08:39.830
Her filming starts today.

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:44.330
It must feel good to stand Yurika-sama up like this.

00:08:44.330 --> 00:08:45.510
We're done here.

00:08:45.510 --> 00:08:46.540
Hold it.

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:49.340
We can't do anything if we're not all here.

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:52.130
So you're saying that you're too sad without Ichigo around.

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:56.020
There's no meaning to practice if all five of us aren't here to match our singing and dancing.

00:08:56.020 --> 00:08:57.630
That's true, but...

00:08:57.630 --> 00:08:59.140
Still...

00:09:00.640 --> 00:09:02.490
How's the lighting?

00:09:02.490 --> 00:09:05.410
It might be better to make the light a bit softer.

00:09:06.150 --> 00:09:08.730
Hoshimiya-san is now on standby.

00:09:08.730 --> 00:09:10.410
Good morning!

00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:12.960
What do you think?

00:09:12.960 --> 00:09:15.420
Director, good morning.

00:09:15.420 --> 00:09:16.860
It's really cute!

00:09:17.810 --> 00:09:20.100
We've even got a bunk bed prepared.

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:23.870
Is that because you found out I have a brother?

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:27.800
That's right, it's all based around <i>you</i> as the protagonist.

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:31.820
The protagonist is a normal girl. {but Ichigo is a gokuGOKU futsuu no onna no ko!}

00:09:31.820 --> 00:09:37.050
After fighting with her brother, she lays an Angely Bear on his pillow to apologize.

00:09:37.050 --> 00:09:39.050
Starting rehearsal.

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:45.050
Keep going.

00:09:45.050 --> 00:09:47.060
Huh? But isn't it a rehearsal?

00:09:48.060 --> 00:09:53.000
When the director wants to capture natural expressions, he keeps the camera rolling without a word.

00:09:57.570 --> 00:09:58.640
Cut!

00:09:58.640 --> 00:10:00.830
That was a great take. Save it!

00:10:01.150 --> 00:10:02.330
Thanks!

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:06.870
I'm dead tired.

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:07.710
Well done.

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:10.540
Here. Look over the interview transcript.

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:12.220
The one for the pamphlet?

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:18.720
You're quite stiff, Miss.

00:10:19.100 --> 00:10:20.470
Even my legs?

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:22.540
Stiff as a stick. {sturgeon? summer day? strawberry? staph infection?}

00:10:22.540 --> 00:10:24.400
Ouchie!

00:10:26.860 --> 00:10:27.940
Is it hard?

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:32.670
Yeah, but it's fun.

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:40.240
Go over things yet?

00:10:45.240 --> 00:10:47.460
It was the first day of shooting, after all.

00:10:47.460 --> 00:10:49.140
Let's let her get a good night's sleep.

00:10:49.140 --> 00:10:50.250
Yeah.

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:05.010
What time is it?!

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:06.370
Already five?!

00:11:06.370 --> 00:11:07.690
It's morning!

00:11:08.310 --> 00:11:09.350
What's wrong?

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:12.360
I fell asleep! Sorry, the training...

00:11:12.360 --> 00:11:15.150
It's alright, everyone understands.

00:11:15.150 --> 00:11:17.040
Sorry...

00:11:17.040 --> 00:11:20.650
I'm the most behind, so I know I need to work the hardest.

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:26.140
And because you can't help but worry, I prepared a special little something.

00:11:29.470 --> 00:11:30.290
What's this?

00:11:30.640 --> 00:11:31.910
A video.

00:11:31.910 --> 00:11:33.280
Just watch it.

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:40.050
What kind of video could this be?

00:11:40.050 --> 00:11:42.300
Galaxy! Amazing!

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:45.680
It's dance lesson video!

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:47.460
Sensei, you're too close!

00:11:47.460 --> 00:11:50.190
Sorry. Same to you, Starmiya.

00:11:50.190 --> 00:11:52.410
Now then, we're counting on you to film us well.

00:11:52.410 --> 00:11:53.690
Okay!

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:55.400
Ah, it's Sakura-chan!

00:11:55.400 --> 00:11:59.940
Though I am no match for her, I will be taking on Ichigo-sama's role.

00:11:59.940 --> 00:12:03.950
Now, even during shooting, you can practice and practice!

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:05.840
Music start!

00:12:12.300 --> 00:12:14.420
Hoshimiya-san, we're ready.

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:15.710
Ah, right!

00:12:17.180 --> 00:12:19.390
Was the dance video able to help at all?

00:12:19.390 --> 00:12:21.840
A ton! Thanks so much, Sakura-chan.

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:23.990
Sorry to spring this on you so suddenly.

00:12:23.990 --> 00:12:27.850
I was so surprised how you learned Ichigo-tan's part so quickly.

00:12:27.850 --> 00:12:30.150
You speak too highly! I...

00:12:30.150 --> 00:12:32.850
Upon hearing of my senior's crisis,

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:35.600
even if I were to walk through flame and torrent,

00:12:35.600 --> 00:12:42.750
I would gladly engrave one or two dances upon this soul!

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:52.070
I was slow.

00:12:52.830 --> 00:12:54.860
Ichigo, take a quick break.

00:12:54.860 --> 00:12:57.210
Sakura, step in so she can watch.

00:12:57.580 --> 00:12:58.420
Okay.

00:12:58.510 --> 00:13:00.640
I-I need some blood...

00:13:00.640 --> 00:13:03.920
Which do you prefer, Otome's blood or tomato juice?

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:05.810
Sorry about this, Sakura-chan.

00:13:05.810 --> 00:13:06.770
Not a problem.

00:13:06.770 --> 00:13:08.430
Yurika-chan, you ready?

00:13:11.240 --> 00:13:12.930
Just who do you think I am?

00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:14.640
Alright, let's start!

00:13:24.870 --> 00:13:26.350
You're still not sleeping?

00:13:26.940 --> 00:13:28.200
Just a bit more.

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:30.450
Tomorrow's the last day of filming, isn't it?

00:13:30.450 --> 00:13:32.470
Do you really want to show up with bags under your eyes?

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:37.100
We'll train more later.

00:13:37.100 --> 00:13:39.960
Ran, Yurika-sama, and everyone will come too.

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:41.780
Thanks.

00:13:41.780 --> 00:13:42.960
Good night.

00:13:44.680 --> 00:13:45.970
Good night.

00:13:58.940 --> 00:14:01.570
Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:14:01.570 --> 00:14:04.120
Ran's taking the lead and even shouting out pace. {eh... I guess this is fine}

00:14:04.120 --> 00:14:06.580
Someone has to take charge since Ichigo's not here.

00:14:06.580 --> 00:14:08.070
Don't drag your feet.

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:11.200
Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:14:16.150 --> 00:14:17.250
Cut.

00:14:20.270 --> 00:14:21.340
Director?

00:14:21.340 --> 00:14:24.470
Do you have something on your mind?

00:14:24.470 --> 00:14:29.090
I'd just like for you to have fun and enjoy yourself for this scene.

00:14:34.080 --> 00:14:35.600
Let's take a break.

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:37.590
Waiting for the clouds to clear!

00:14:45.240 --> 00:14:48.030
Be careful of UV rays even when it's cloudy.

00:14:49.530 --> 00:14:50.660
Amahane-san!

00:14:51.640 --> 00:14:53.660
Nice to see you again.

00:14:56.740 --> 00:14:59.160
Thank you very much for choosing me.

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:02.780
I'm happy that you decided to take us up on the offer.

00:15:02.780 --> 00:15:05.170
I've been wanting to come watch for a while.

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:08.640
Wondering if you're having fun and giving your all.

00:15:11.920 --> 00:15:15.180
What's wrong? Go ahead and tell me.

00:15:15.180 --> 00:15:19.180
Don't worry, I'll make it our little secret.

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:25.130
I've actually got another gig going on.

00:15:25.130 --> 00:15:27.190
There's a live concert coming up.

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:29.290
Oh my, sounds fun!

00:15:29.290 --> 00:15:34.420
But I'm really behind on practice, and I'm just holding everyone else back...

00:15:34.420 --> 00:15:37.200
I'm not sure if it's alright for me to join them on stage.

00:15:38.190 --> 00:15:40.960
Did you get the Angely Bear I sent?

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:42.220
I did!

00:15:42.220 --> 00:15:44.790
I'm sorry for not thanking you yet.

00:15:44.790 --> 00:15:46.460
It made me really happy.

00:15:47.370 --> 00:15:50.720
I'm glad. I sent it so that I could see that face.

00:15:50.720 --> 00:15:51.970
Face?

00:15:51.970 --> 00:15:58.190
At first, I created the Angely Bear for my own children.

00:15:58.190 --> 00:16:02.090
As it got more popular, I made more for relatives, friends,

00:16:02.090 --> 00:16:06.980
and then for fans of Angely Sugar around the world.

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:10.140
I heard that it's really meaningful to you.

00:16:10.740 --> 00:16:14.720
Correct. That fact didn't change even after I made more.

00:16:14.720 --> 00:16:19.240
I carefully stitch my wish into each and every single one.

00:16:19.550 --> 00:16:20.500
Your wish?

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:24.000
For everyone to be smiling.

00:16:25.180 --> 00:16:26.630
Smiling...

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:29.100
The reason I chose you

00:16:29.100 --> 00:16:34.000
was because I was certain that you would be able to deliver that wish to everyone.

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:40.140
You have the same power as these bears when you stand upon a stage.

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:48.770
You're an idol who can bring a smile to everyone's face.

00:16:59.400 --> 00:17:02.220
It cleared up! The sunlight is perfect!

00:17:02.220 --> 00:17:04.790
Good, then let's get rolling.

00:17:17.980 --> 00:17:19.100
Hey, Aoi?

00:17:19.100 --> 00:17:22.060
I'm right in front of the station, and...

00:17:23.080 --> 00:17:24.060
Ichigo!

00:17:24.380 --> 00:17:26.060
Aoi! Everyone else too!

00:17:27.040 --> 00:17:28.060
Why are you here?

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:29.440
We came to pick you up.

00:17:29.440 --> 00:17:30.630
Ichigo-tan!

00:17:30.630 --> 00:17:32.730
Did you finish up the filming?

00:17:32.730 --> 00:17:33.320
Yeah!

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:36.070
But really, I can't believe you're all here.

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:37.820
Weren't you about to ask me something?

00:17:39.540 --> 00:17:40.330
Right.

00:17:40.330 --> 00:17:45.330
I want to be in the concert! Please help me with training!

00:17:48.320 --> 00:17:49.000
Of course!

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:51.340
There are still a ton of parts we need to go over.

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:55.870
I napped a lot today so I'd be ready and charged for more training with you!

00:17:55.870 --> 00:17:58.440
Nothing can start if you're not around.

00:17:58.440 --> 00:17:59.340
Right!

00:17:59.340 --> 00:18:01.460
Seatbelts all okay?

00:18:01.460 --> 00:18:03.310
Here we go, take off!

00:18:04.140 --> 00:18:08.100
Go! Go! Yeah! {Anything but love you}

00:18:08.770 --> 00:18:12.520
It's almost time for Ichigo-chan and her friends to go on.

00:18:12.520 --> 00:18:13.650
Yes.

00:18:15.110 --> 00:18:16.260
It's time.

00:18:17.020 --> 00:18:18.110
I'm so nervous...

00:18:18.110 --> 00:18:19.610
Girls, hands in!

00:18:20.870 --> 00:18:22.900
We've done everything we can.

00:18:22.900 --> 00:18:24.990
Don't worry about messing up out there.

00:18:24.990 --> 00:18:26.110
Let's have fun!

00:18:26.110 --> 00:18:27.240
Right!

00:18:27.240 --> 00:18:28.750
Ready, and—

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:31.000
Yeah!

00:21:29.510 --> 00:21:31.260
A Melody Musical.

00:21:57.370 --> 00:22:00.000
Hurry, hurry!

00:22:00.390 --> 00:22:02.250
Stop pulling me!

00:22:02.250 --> 00:22:04.630
Yurika-chan, be more quiet.

00:22:04.630 --> 00:22:05.880
Right.

00:22:05.880 --> 00:22:07.140
Is it time yet?

00:22:07.140 --> 00:22:08.130
Just about.

00:22:10.780 --> 00:22:12.870
Sorry for leaving you alone.

00:22:12.870 --> 00:22:15.270
But it's alright now. {all right?}

00:22:15.830 --> 00:22:18.120
Any time and place, we're together.

00:22:18.120 --> 00:22:19.560
Angely Bear.

00:23:55.670 --> 00:23:57.790
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism!

00:23:58.770 --> 00:24:00.300
Man, I'm beat.

00:24:00.300 --> 00:24:02.280
Doubling up is really tough.

00:24:02.280 --> 00:24:05.400
I've got no problems eating three or four times as many sweets though.

00:24:05.400 --> 00:24:07.420
Is that the same as doubling up?

00:24:07.820 --> 00:24:09.920
Double up in moderation.

00:24:10.440 --> 00:24:11.680
There's amazing news!

00:24:11.680 --> 00:24:12.430
What is it?

00:24:12.430 --> 00:24:15.100
If you pass the next audition you can be with Mizuki-san!

00:24:15.100 --> 00:24:18.650
Show me the shine of your stars!

00:24:18.650 --> 00:24:20.020
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:20.020 --> 00:24:21.470
Chance and Try.

00:24:21.470 --> 00:24:23.710
Always passionate, Idol Activities!
